            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.49.34"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yer 49:34",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Elamu yuko huko, na watu wake umati wote, pande zote za kaburi lake; wote pia wameuawa, wameanguka kwa upanga, walioshuka wakiwa hawajatahiriwa hadi pande za chini ya nchi; ambao waliwatia watu hofu katika nchi ya walio hai, nao wamechukua aibu yao, pamoja nao washukao shimoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wamemwekea kitanda kati ya hao waliouawa, pamoja na watu wake umati wote; makaburi yake yamzunguka; wote pia hawakutahiriwa, wameuawa kwa upanga; maana vitisho vyao vilifanyika katika nchi ya walio hai, nao wamechukua aibu yao, pamoja nao washukao shimoni; amewekwa kati ya hao waliouawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:26"
          },
          "items": [
